      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好的，这次要跟训练员一起创造回忆。\n那么──我开动咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "541e8db95b714f0512ed8654a148424ab05d9433e621d103b1acdedf84d02b67",
