      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟目白麦昆一起吃的这碗白色甜汤，\n别有一番滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f3ece142006585ccd926835b862ab4258d6e217489b0ec7898a48dc7d65eb2",
